  "text": "proprium.dominica-iii-post-pascha-secreta",
  "about": "The secreta of the formulary “Third Sunday after Easter” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "May these mysteries grant us, O Lord, that, subduing earthly desires, we may learn to love heavenly things. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, Who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
